"gap_4_blinding_scope","missing_source_classes":["随机化与盲法实施方案"],"target":"盲法实施范围与揭盲流程"},{"action":"确认安慰剂片的具体规格、辅料组成及与试验药外观一致性的验证方法","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_4_placebo_spec","missing_source_classes":["访视流程图"],"target":"安慰剂规格与辅料"},{"action":"确认eCRF设计原则、数据审核会安排、分析集划分规则及数据库锁定流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_4_ecrf_design","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划"],"target":"eCRF设计与数据管理"},{"action":"确认统计分析计划的制定时间、最终确定节点及与数据库锁定的时间关系","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_4_sap_timing","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划"],"target":"SAP制定与最终确定节点"}],"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":["随机化与盲法实施方案","访视流程图","统计分析计划","合并用药指南"],"proposal_text":"本研究为一项随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索试验，在中国开展，旨在对口服sGC激动剂SGC-R11进行概念验证和剂量探索。研究人群为18至75岁慢性心力衰竭（射血分数降低，LVEF≤40%）成人患者，NYHA心功能II至III级，在指南导向标准药物治疗稳定至少4周基础上仍残留症状。研究设SGC-R11 5mg组、SGC-R11 10mg组、SGC-R11 20mg组和安慰剂组共四个平行组，按1:1:1:1比例随机分配。各试验组口服SGC-R11片每日一次，安慰剂组口服外观和包装与试验药一致的安慰剂片每日一次，治疗期均为12周，所有受试者联合标准抗心衰背景治疗。研究时期包括筛选期（第-2周至第0天）、双盲治疗期（第0天至第12周）和安全性随访期（末次给药后4周）。主要终点为第12周血浆NT-proBNP较基线的相对变化（对数尺度），评价时点为基线、第4周、第8周和第12周。估计目标采用治疗策略视角，无论是否终止试验药物或发生伴发事件，均按随机分组评估第12周NT-proBNP较基线变化；敏感性分析采用填补策略处理死亡后缺失。主要分析集为全分析集（FAS），符合方案集（PPS）用于敏感性分析。主要分析采用ANCOVA模型，以基线log-NT-proBNP为协变量，固定效应包含剂量组与分层因素；剂量-效应关系采用Emax模型进行探索性拟合；次要终点按层级序贯检验策略进行统计分析；安全性数据采用描述性统计。本研究不计划自适应设计、样本量再估计、期中分析、安全审查委员会（SRC）或数据安全监查委员会（DMC）。","rationale":"研究设计要素（随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心、II期剂量探索）、四组1:1:1:1分配、12周治疗期、4周安全性随访、主要终点及评价时点、估计目标策略、分析集定义、统计分析方法、不设置自适应/期中分析/DMC等均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。分层随机因素的具体变量、各访视具体检查项目清单、安慰剂具体规格和辅料组成、标准背景治疗允许药物清单、Emax模型具体参数化形式、层级序贯检验具体顺序、死亡后缺失填补具体方法等实施细节未在允许来源中规定，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标、伴发事件、期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_8d540c5cb34647c0","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f1e67da4650fc9268be41748","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261001081111_964f165b","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期剂量探索试验","quote_sha256":"61f9ff3ce2d0aa21f4fa0e60669238ececc1087df70777b2d228130d77836202","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"4组按1:1:1:1随机分配","quote_sha256":"9a3a297295b21d2012dcd664c8b30990356d67fd6995470a478a89d8f2b25bbe","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（第-2周至第0天）：合格性确定；双盲治疗期（第0天至第12周）：随机分组治疗；安全性随访期（末次给药后4周）：不良事件随访","quote_sha256":"ce5b041987eb6b962d955e72fee27b897997311fb0155b5f3ae2e9895382ce6f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es_006"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_5922bd5fc9a7960d:full-draft:f1e67da4650fc9268be41748","quote":"随机化；双盲；安慰剂对照；平行组；多中心","quote_sha256":"2390eec78cb63fbb744f4d0cd34ca9e3a52cae7420fe7f7e88f4c2d12a283514","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:f1e67da4650fc9268be41748","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"试验组与对照组：SGC-R11 5mg组；SGC-R11 10mg组；SGC-R11 20mg组；安慰剂组","quote_sha256":"0a57025ca1b7d3262b41900b00fe913ac7756b0042b8eb1bb3a4d4c64d5bdc59","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es_008"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","quote":"SGC-R11片口服每日一次，连续12周，联合标准抗心衰背景治疗；设5mg、10mg、20mg三个剂量平行组以探索剂量-效应关系","quote_sha256":"794b0069e3154acb05eed52c8e4d5b0f64bfe63195f167d6a817d2779912b2bd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","span_id":"es_009"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_004","es_005","es_006","es_007","es_008","es_009"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认双盲的具体实施范围（受试者、研究者、评价者、数据管理人员等哪些人员设盲）","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_41_blinding_scope","missing_source_classes":["盲法与随机化实施方案"],"target":"盲法实施范围"},{"action":"确认V2分层随机所采用的具体分层变量","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_41_stratification","missing_source_classes":["盲法与随机化实施方案"],"target":"分层随机因素"},{"action":"逐项列出第12周V5访视的具体评估和检查项目","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_41_v5_assessment","missing_source_classes":["访视流程图"],"target":"V5主要终点全套评估项目"},{"action":"明确第16周电话随访的具体评估项目、数据采集范围及操作规范","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_41_v6_content","missing_source_classes":["电话随访操作规范"],"target":"V6电话随访评估内容"},{"action":"确认安慰剂片的具体规格、辅料组成及外观匹配验证","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_41_placebo_spec","missing_source_classes":["安慰剂处方文件"],"target":"安慰剂规格与辅料"}],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":["盲法与随机化实施方案","访视流程图","电话随访操作规范","安慰剂处方文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计。受试者按1:1:1:1比例随机分配至SGC-R11 5mg组、SGC-R11 10mg组、SGC-R11 20mg组或安慰剂组。各试验组口服SGC-R11片每日一次，安慰剂组口服外观和包装与试验药一致的安慰剂片每日一次，治疗期均为12周，所有受试者联合标准抗心衰背景治疗。研究时期包括筛选期（第-2周至第0天）、双盲治疗期（第0天至第12周）和安全性随访期（末次给药后4周）。访视安排为：V1筛选访视（第-2周）完成病史采集、体格检查、实验室检查、NT-proBNP检测、心电图及超声心动图；V2随机访视（第0天）完成分层随机及发药；V3访视（第4周）进行安全性评估、NT-proBNP检测及6分钟步行试验；V4访视（第8周）进行安全性评估及KCCQ评估；V5访视（第12周）进行主要终点全套评估；V6访视（第16周）通过电话随访进行安全性评估。","rationale":"总体设计要素（随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心）来自章节包已确认内容。四组1:1:1:1分配、12周治疗期、4周安全性随访、各访视具体检查项目（V1至V6）均来自当前项目已确认研究事实。盲法具体实施范围（哪些人员设盲）、分层随机因素、V5主要终点全套评估的具体项目清单、V6电话随访的具体评估内容、安慰剂具体规格等未在允许来源中明确，需医学经理确认。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_fcd1d218683bb031","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:f1e67da4650fc9268be41748","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:46d82ed9e2e3ef","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:3809927f2ae07b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"ea7c2105cf82388ae0ff3946409bc63a6a3634f54b62d04f5132c4750bd1f668","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_bb41368e3c4b_5922bd5fc9a7960d:full-draft:f1e67da4650fc9268be41748","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:f1e67da4650fc9268be41748","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:7c91e7c1f7976522b36f466f3ccd4e65739d7618408eef192af66168a0786719:f1e67da4650fc9268be41748","text_sha256":"ea7c2105cf82388ae0ff3946409bc63a6a3634f54b62d04f5132c4750bd1f668"},{"content_sha256":"b27186fa03b5e482bdf4807db173a2025f3ebf4adf1f98851cc1c0f8fdd214a1","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:revision:5","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_2e4d15ec70150b2f54b8:r5:3b192f25f867c4a8","text_sha256":"b27186fa03b5e482bdf4807db173a2025f3ebf4adf1f98851cc1c0f8fdd214a1"},{"content_sha256":"d201ce569054cbbf7236